('707788fe-e1f6-5b00-a505-55323a181f8d'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Immunology and Genetics', 'Which cell type expresses CD56?', '["Neutrophils","B cells","Eosinophils","T cells","NK cells"]'::jsonb, 'NK cells', 'CD56 is a marker for NK cells and some T cell subsets.'),
