('209c5b8e-c6a6-557d-ba6f-d431bdd9d14e'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Immunology and Genetics', 'CD8 is a marker for:', '["NK cells","B cells","Macrophages","Helper T cells","Cytotoxic T cells"]'::jsonb, 'Cytotoxic T cells', 'CD8 is expressed on cytotoxic T cells, recognizing MHC class I.'),
('0a76803c-616d-533f-9dc6-8c96f071865f'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Immunology and Genetics', 'Dendritic cells have which shape/structure?', '["Stellate/dendritic with long processes","Bilobed nucleus","Round with no processes","Multinucleated","Granular cytoplasm"]'::jsonb, 'Stellate/dendritic with long processes', 'Dendritic cells have long cytoplasmic processes (dendrites) for antigen capture.'),
('708dd8d5-6969-5eea-997a-25754e22da8c'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Immunology and Genetics', 'Toll-like receptors (TLRs) recognize:', '["Cytokines","Complement proteins","Antibodies","Pathogen","Specific antigen epitopes"]'::jsonb, 'Pathogen', 'TLRs are pattern recognition receptors that recognize conserved microbial PAMPs.'),
('23ef40e7-08f3-5a8b-ba92-91620f4ca69d'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Immunology and Genetics', 'TLR4 recognizes:', '["Peptidoglycan clinical presentation","Flagellin clinical presentation","dsRNA clinical presentation","LPS (lipopolysaccharide) of Gram-negative bacteria","CpG DNA clinical presentation"]'::jsonb, 'LPS (lipopolysaccharide) of Gram-negative bacteria', 'TLR4 in complex with MD-2 and CD14 recognizes LPS from Gram-negative bacteria.'),
