('86dbf778-e711-5b62-ab88-e11120749702'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Immunology and Genetics', 'The inflammasome is a complex that activates:', '["TNF-alpha","Complement","Caspase-1 and IL-1beta","IL-2","IFN-gamma"]'::jsonb, 'Caspase-1 and IL-1beta', 'Inflammasome activates caspase-1 which processes pro-IL-1beta and pro-IL-18 to active forms.'),
