('80727447-4faa-51f4-9fa1-266d27ebabab'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Immunology and Genetics', 'Mucosal immunity is mediated primarily by:', '["Secretory IgA","IgM","IgD","IgG","IgE"]'::jsonb, 'Secretory IgA', 'sIgA is the main antibody in mucosal secretions, protecting against mucosal pathogens.'),
