('26a6d4cb-0d2b-5132-88d6-0d46701b8d05'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Infection Control', 'Water quality for reprocessing endoscopes:', '["Sterile water for final rinse","Tap water","No water needed","Saline","Distilled water"]'::jsonb, 'Sterile water for final rinse', 'Final rinse: sterile water to prevent recontamination. Follow AAMI standards.'),
