('4215f13c-5371-5f83-a59a-00ddbf91129b'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Infection Control', 'Single-use devices (SUD):', '["No regulation clinical presentation clinical presentation","Sterilize and reuse clinical presentation clinical presentation","Reuse always clinical presentation clinical presentation","Safe to reuse clinical presentation clinical presentation","Designed for one use only. Do not reprocess unless FDA-cleared for reprocessing"]'::jsonb, 'Designed for one use only. Do not reprocess unless FDA-cleared for reprocessing', 'SUD: reprocessing risk. Only if FDA-cleared with validated protocols.'),
('308d3365-2731-5913-916f-8fbba642ff2e'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Infection Control', 'Hospital infection control committee includes:', '["Only doctors clinical presentation clinical presentation","Only nurses clinical presentation clinical presentation","No committee clinical presentation clinical presentation","Only administrators clinical presentation clinical presentation","Infection control doctor, nurse, microbiologist, pharmacist, administrator"]'::jsonb, 'Infection control doctor, nurse, microbiologist, pharmacist, administrator', 'IC committee: multidisciplinary. Oversees surveillance, outbreaks, policies.'),
('bbea0382-59aa-5292-bcee-ae7832f7da2d'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Infection Control', 'Hand hygiene compliance is monitored by:', '["Not needed clinical presentation clinical presentation","Direct observation, electronic monitoring, product usage measurement","Yearly only clinical presentation clinical presentation","No monitoring clinical presentation clinical presentation","Self-report clinical presentation clinical presentation"]'::jsonb, 'Direct observation, electronic monitoring, product usage measurement', 'Hand hygiene: WHO recommends direct observation as gold standard.'),
('69457147-6b8f-5904-85f4-2dac8e0b81cd'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Infection Control', 'Attribution of HAIs (Device-associated infection rates):', '["Per month","Per 1000 patient-days","Per 1000 device-days","Per 100 admissions","Per 100 procedures"]'::jsonb, 'Per 1000 device-days', 'Device-associated rates: standardized. Compare across units/hospitals.'),
('7fe53e95-396a-53e9-a7f3-00779cf623ba'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Infection Control', 'The chain of infection includes:', '["Transmission only clinical presentation clinical presentation","Environment only clinical presentation clinical presentation","Agent only clinical presentation clinical presentation","Host only clinical presentation clinical presentation","Infectious agent, reservoir, portal of exit, transmission, portal of entry, susceptible host"]'::jsonb, 'Infectious agent, reservoir, portal of exit, transmission, portal of entry, susceptible host', 'Chain of infection: break any link to prevent infection.'),
('55b6b14e-9593-5362-9ab8-9006827edb1b'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Infection Control', 'Reservoir of infection in healthcare:', '["Patients, healthcare workers, environment, equipment, water, air","Environment only clinical presentation","No reservoirs clinical presentation","Patients only clinical presentation","Staff only clinical presentation"]'::jsonb, 'Patients, healthcare workers, environment, equipment, water, air', 'Reservoirs: colonized/infected patients, contaminated equipment, environment.'),
('389d6daa-1577-5935-a060-78446e7d9cca'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 2)', 'Infection Control', 'Portal of exit for respiratory infections:', '["Urine","Blood","Respiratory secretions","Stool","Skin"]'::jsonb, 'Respiratory secretions', 'Portal of exit: respiratory (droplets/aerosols). Control with masks, respiratory hygiene.'),
